{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_beewax_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_beewax_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"黃沙歸途","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_beewax_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"55cb753d040524365ca26fd0d52b140dfd8d108bfa58fd0d2c34728eb6e2b1f9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g2_luo_reception"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅德島駐薩爾貢某辦事處"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......刷子、精油、磨砂石，都帶好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？小蟲子，怎麼跑到包裹裡來了，你要和我一起走嗎？不行哦，快走開快走開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦！都包好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，再等一下，臨走前得好好和這裡的卡蒂姆先生道別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"這個混帳走就走了，把東西丟到門口算什麼事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡蒂姆先生，對、對不起，我不該把蟲子丟到門口的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"安克赫娜小姐，不、不是的，我不是在說你，你不要誤會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說我嗎......卡蒂姆先生，是發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這都是你來之前的事了，上個月在這裡的一位臨時幹員病發去世，我打包了他的遺物準備寄回他的家鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"但本地的信使一聽到物品的主人是感染者，都覺得晦氣不肯寄送。明明經過處理後一點感染的風險也不會有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可是你在這裡做了這麼多事情，派發藥物，收治病人，還經常傳授給大家預防的辦法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"相比礦石病在人們心中鑄成的傷害與恐懼，我們所做的......實在是微不足道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是這樣嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要怪就怪我這條傷腿太不爭氣，不能自己去送，再等些時日吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不說這些了，看你已經打包好行李了，是打算今天就離開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，前天接到了從羅德島發來的消息，姐姐不在那裡，也不希望我去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然並未講清緣由，但姐姐這麼做一定有自己的道理，我尊重她的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"可你看起來真的很失落啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒關係的，我也有自己的試煉要完成，總是追著姐姐的腳步也實在是不像話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"安克赫娜小姐能夠這麼想，就已經是很不錯的一步了，往後的行程你有沒有什麼目標和計劃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......要去哪裡完全沒有想過呢......沒關係，路上慢慢想也來得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，來，行李給我，讓我送送你吧，這些天幸虧有你幫我，我一個人帶著這條傷腿難免手忙腳亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有沒有，都是舉手之勞，反而是我才應該好好感激卡蒂姆先生的照顧呢！說到感激......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不用，言重了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡蒂姆先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是這些遺物的話，我可以幫你送去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾貢的沙漠雖然廣袤無際，但是我們部族久處大漠，如何在沙漠中行進是我們從小就要學習的技能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"這不會耽誤你的試煉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的，幫助別人也是試煉的一環，很重要的一環！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"這些話要是別人說給我聽，我一定會嗤之以鼻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"可是安克赫娜小姐啊......能夠孤身一人從大漠深處的部落找到這裡來，我實在是沒有拒絕的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢所以呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我啊，只好把那傢伙的東西交給你了，安克赫娜小姐，請你務必要送它們回到他的家鄉啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，這是他唯一留下的願望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我知道的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽卡蒂姆先生的描述，要去的地方似乎是個封閉的部落，不是很確定具體的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......雖然他叮囑我出了村子嚴格按照方向牌的指示去走肯定能找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？感覺有些忐忑啊......方向牌指西是一片梭梭林，指東就是要去的紅沙地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雙手合攏）金沙之地，落日歸處。神靈之眷，隨行千里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無顏的神靈啊，請庇佑我順利穿過那片沙原，讓漂泊多年的靈魂回到他的家鄉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出發吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一陣風吹過，那塊指示牌發出令人牙酸的吱呀聲，在風中緩緩地轉起了圈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太陽......太陽又升起來了，我已經走了一天嗎？放眼望去，四周都是梭梭，怎麼還沒走到那片紅色的沙地啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡蒂姆先生說的下一個指示牌又在哪裡啊？不是說走個半天就可以見到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好累......走不動了，得找片陰涼處坐著歇一歇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有具體的位置，路線又偏移了，我要怎麼才能找到他的家鄉啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是姐姐在就好了......她在的話一定會拍拍我的腦袋告訴我沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低頭看向自己的手）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......也不是不可以。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（手放在自己腦袋上拍拍）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，安克赫娜，不要沮喪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜下來，會有辦法的，站起來看看四周的環境，從中尋找頭緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，先站起來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛、好痛，踩到衣擺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，東西都撒出來了，得趕快撿起來才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，不要跑啊，怎麼這個時候刮起了風。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......日記嗎？對不起，先生，我不是故意要看的，是風把紙頁吹起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（闔上筆記本）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......剛剛那一小段，是那位先生對自己家鄉的記述嗎？說不定......我可以從裡面找到一些線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神靈啊，請您原諒我對亡者的冒犯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打開筆記本）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“無數次夢中，我回到家，母親就站在那片椰棗林下等我歸來，正如當初目送我離開。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我的身體一日不如一日，對那片綠洲的思念卻越發強烈，我為了夢想離開她，卻在離開後的每一個夜晚夢到她。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“雨季和旱季交替，積水蓄成湖泊，而後又迅速乾涸為鹽灘......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他真的很懷念那裡啊，幾乎整本日記都是在家鄉的往事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"椰棗林、綠洲、時令湖......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有小蟲子爬行......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抓起來仔細端詳）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該離水源不遠了，運氣好的話，或許能碰到聚落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要翻越好幾座沙丘啊，還好帶了滑沙的木板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敲敲，嗯......還得好好再綁一綁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來可能會有點顛簸，得把衣服挽起來，再摔倒就不好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一、二、三，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇哇哇哇——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見多識廣的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡提到的小鎮啊......讓我想想，我是去過的，過了這麼多年也不知道還在不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老人家，您知道怎麼去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見多識廣的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"騎著馱獸一路往西北方向去，遇到一座形似蘑菇的岩體後，再往西南走個幾公里應該就能到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您對這個小鎮附近的環境有印象嗎？有沒有一片椰棗林？雨季的時候周邊會出現時令湖嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見多識廣的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有印象，不好意思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“絕望之際，卡蒂姆先生救了我。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“在辦事處一段時間後，我的病情趨於穩定，心情也逐漸平靜......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來，他之後就一直生活在辦事處，直到離世。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馱獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噗噗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你餓了嗎？我這裡還有些乾草。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馱獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（咀嚼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看你吃的，一地唾沫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博聞強識的婦人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要找的地方不好找啊，小姑娘。鎮子的北面分佈著大大小小好幾個綠洲，幾乎每一處都有大片的椰棗林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......如果加上時令湖這個條件，是不是能篩掉一些地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博聞強識的婦人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很難，時令湖的位置從不固定，拿它當座標並不靠譜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不介意的話，可以麻煩您在這張地圖上圈出這些綠洲的大概位置嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博聞強識的婦人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你難道要一個個去找嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我答應過別人，就一定要辦到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“終於，我存夠了離開這裡的錢，我不知道這片沙漠對面有什麼，但正是那些未知的事物，令我心癢難耐。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“但願我的一腔熱血能有所收穫，再見了，我的故鄉。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙漠行商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，小姑娘，你在念什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......一位先生的過往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙漠行商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就是日記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙漠行商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論是什麼你都得停下了，你要去的地方就在這附近，小姑娘，我們還要趕路，就把你放在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，謝謝您捎我這一程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙漠行商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，哪裡的話，要不是你從流沙中救起了我的車隊，我早就命喪黃沙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"願這片沙地庇佑您接下來的旅程！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙漠行商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，謝謝！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是最後一處綠洲了，無顏的神靈，請您不吝，賜我一個奇跡吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，請問有人在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看這裡破敗的樣子，根本不像有人居住啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"是你未經允許進入了我們部族的領地，異族人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我一路上過來都沒有看到人，就以為是無主的綠洲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然看不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，問話前不如先收起你的長杖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"（明明是我受制於她，怎麼這丫頭反而一臉委屈？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"異族人，你來這裡到底有何貴幹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我接到委託，要送一位先生的遺物回到他的故鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"東西都在這個包裡了，您看一眼吧，如果他不是這裡的人，我立刻就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"拿過來吧，讓我看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"有這麼多年不曾歸來，原來他已經離世了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯， 按輩分，他算我的堂弟。他母親離世前一直也是我在照顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了您，他還有別的親人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"異族人，這個部族已經沒有幾個人了，年紀小的，都跑去外面討生活了，剩下些年紀大的，也是一年少過一年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人了，部族以後要怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你還不明白嗎，小丫頭？我們的部族已經快要消失了，從綠洲，從薩爾貢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......這些東西，要怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我會把這些物品埋在他母親身邊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不安地捏緊長杖）既然東西送到了，那我、我還是儘早離開，不再打攪為好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"小丫頭，你來都來了，留下來幫幫我吧，雖然回來的只有遺物沒有遺體，但魂歸故里，還是要有個體面的葬禮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，沒問題的，我、我都可以幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"那跟我來吧，該著手準備了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，我、我可以問您一個問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大家都離開了，為什麼您還堅持留在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是部族的祭司啊，在部族消失前，總得有一個人繼續守護它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"何況，萬一有人想要回到這裡呢？就像他一樣......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_falls_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你要撒第一捧土嗎，小丫頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你是帶他回來的人，理應如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，我受卡蒂姆先生之托將你的遺物帶回你的家鄉，如今我已到達，這一路上發生的意外請你原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"那些土地上結出的苦果，終將落回土地，深埋其下，靜待發芽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我親愛的兄弟，願你回到慈母的懷抱，願你在黃土下得到安息，願你去往的地方永無呻吟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（願金色沙原賜福於他。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"很感激你願意幫我，要去吃些東西嗎？這一路上辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有沒有，這樣的路程對於我們族人來說都是小兒科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我從未離開過這片綠洲，你們沙漠部落的生活方式我實在難以想像，滾滾黃沙，看了只覺得害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可怕的，沙原裡居住著神靈，祂會眷顧我們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我們深信在森林中也有神靈棲身，正因祂的庇佑，部族才得以順利生存與發展，如今看來，我們應該是被祂遺棄在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的，神靈不會遺棄祂的子民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是祂的子民先拋棄了自己的信仰呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是指那些離開的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"他在外面過得好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好，他得了一種無法治癒的病，身上會長石頭，很痛苦，還會傳染給別人，因此處處遭人白眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"那他走得痛苦嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，我到那裡的時候他已經病逝了......但是有卡蒂姆先生的照顧，應該會安穩一些，至少不是孤苦無依。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"卡蒂姆先生又是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他工作地點的負責人，對礦石病的醫治很有經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我從前一直埋怨他不願回來見自己母親最後一面，明明信裡提到過自己落腳的地方距離這裡步行只要一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然......這麼近嗎？嗚......實不相瞞，我走到半路迷路了，找到這裡足足花了我半個多月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"或許寄出那封信後，他又動身去往其他的地方了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"現在聽你這麼說，我多多少少也理解了他不願意回來的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部族祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡從來沒有人得過那樣的疾病，他要是回來，面對他的病痛，我束手無策。要是再傳染給其他人，估計我只會更加焦頭爛額。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"安克赫娜張開嘴，卻發現接下來的話無論如何也說不出來了。\n一個人若決意要穿越一片大沙漠，便不能再回頭，因為順著風向流動的沙丘必然會吞沒來時的路途。\n而那些為了走向未來而好不容易積蓄起的勇氣，往往也並不足以讓人回頭直視面目全非的過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂愁的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部落長老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老傢伙，當著孩子的面不要唉聲歎氣，會給她們帶來黴運的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂愁的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這老東西，自己白鬍子一大把還好意思說我老。你自己看看，今年遊歷回來的人只有往年的一半，這樣下去怎麼是好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部落長老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我又怎麼能左右這些年輕人的想法，見識過部落之外的精彩紛呈，又有幾個人願意返回這裡安於一隅呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂愁的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這樣坦然，部落遲早有一天要淪落到朝不保夕的境地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部落長老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也是無計可施，總不能扣著那些孩子不許他們離開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂愁的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（無奈搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部落長老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，還有一件事要同你商量，前些天我收到了一封信，裡面提到一件事讓我很不安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂愁的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部落長老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有個孩子得了那種病想要回來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂愁的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好事哪，回來好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部落長老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他說自己身患絕症，怕回到部落會傳染族人......可看孩子流落在外，我還是不忍心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂愁的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這可如何是好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_billro_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拉拉卡涅利安的袖子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_billro_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，安克赫娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再過一年你就要去外面遊歷了，出去了，你還會回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_billro_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安克赫娜，我當然會回來，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_billro_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不清楚祂對我究竟有怎樣的安排，如果祂並不想我留下呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的......姐姐離開後，我會一直向祂祈禱，只要是祂的兒女，所居之處必將遠離邪穢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_billro_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是邪穢，安克赫娜，不是的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g2_luo_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哪位啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡蒂姆先生，是我，安克赫娜，麻煩你開開門好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"來了來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"安克赫娜小姐，你不是應該在遊歷途中嗎？怎麼樣，東西送到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是先進來坐著緩口氣吧。來，喝口水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我送到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕咚咕咚，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後和當地的祭司一起好好安葬了他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，你回來不會就是為了向我彙報結果吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"看你這一頭大汗，不是說了不必專門回來這一趟嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，我想到了，想到了自己要做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，你的遊歷有目標了？快給我講講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去羅德島，去它的本艦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安克赫娜","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡有些東西，我想要帶回到部落裡面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這句話她講得是如此鏗鏘有力，全然不似往常柔軟的語調，像窗外那顆沉甸甸的夕陽，狠狠砸在焦黃的大漠上。\n而她額間的標記，在這輪夕陽的照耀下，熠熠閃光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
